---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';

const thesisChapters = await getCollection('thesis');
thesisChapters.sort((a, b) => a.data.chapterNumber - b.data.chapterNumber);
---

<Layout 
	title="The Book — The Economics of Colonial Slavery | Danish West Indies"
	description="Pre-order the self-published book based on our Master's Thesis. A comprehensive economic history of the Danish West Indies, 1672–1917."
>
	<div class="page-container animate-fade-in">
		<a href="/thesis" class="back-link">← Back to Thesis Portal</a>

		<!-- HERO SECTION -->
		<section class="book-hero">
			<div class="hero-image">
				<img src="/images/book-cover.jpg" alt="The Economics of Colonial Slavery — Book Cover" class="cover-img" />
			</div>
			<div class="hero-text">
				<span class="label">Coming Soon</span>
				<h1>The Economics of Colonial Slavery</h1>
				<p class="hero-subtitle">The Danish West Indies, 1672–1917</p>
				<p class="hero-authors">By Anton Meier Ebsen Jørgensen, Jonas Amasa Skov Nielsen & Sheng Ye Michael Chen</p>
				<p class="hero-blurb">
					What did it cost to enslave a human being? How did Danish colonial bureaucrats reduce an Akwamu child named Kwasi to a 50-Rigsdaler line item in a tax ledger? 
					This book, born from a Master's Thesis in Economic History at the University of Copenhagen, traces the brutal financial architecture of Denmark's Caribbean empire — from the slave ships of the <em>Vestindisk-guineisk Kompagni</em> to the royal balance sheets of Amalienborg Palace.
				</p>
				<div class="hero-cta">
					<a href="#notify" class="btn-primary">Get Notified on Launch</a>
					<a href="#preview" class="btn-secondary">Preview the Contents</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- KEY FACTS -->
		<section class="key-facts">
			<div class="fact"><span class="fact-number">245+</span><span class="fact-label">Years of Colonial History</span></div>
			<div class="fact"><span class="fact-number">15</span><span class="fact-label">Thesis Chapters</span></div>
			<div class="fact"><span class="fact-number">3</span><span class="fact-label">Authors</span></div>
			<div class="fact"><span class="fact-number">1000+</span><span class="fact-label">Archival Records Analyzed</span></div>
		</section>

		<!-- BACK COVER BLURB -->
		<section class="blurb-section">
			<h2>About the Book</h2>
			<div class="blurb-content">
				<p>For 245 years, Denmark operated a colonial empire in the Caribbean that most Danes today know almost nothing about. The islands of St. Thomas, St. John, and St. Croix were the engine rooms of a vast economic machine — one fueled by the labor of tens of thousands of enslaved Africans.</p>
				<p>This book goes beyond the familiar narratives of rebellion and emancipation. Drawing on thousands of previously undigitized archival records from the Danish National Archives (<em>Rigsarkivet</em>), the authors reconstruct the cold financial logic of the plantation system: the price of a human body, the "acceptable" mortality rate of the "seasoning" period, the cost-benefit analysis of cruelty, and the staggering royal profits that flowed directly into Copenhagen.</p>
				<p>It is a work of economic history that refuses to let numbers obscure the humanity behind them.</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- TABLE OF CONTENTS PREVIEW -->
		<section class="toc-section" id="preview">
			<h2>Table of Contents</h2>
			<p class="toc-intro">The book is structured around the thesis chapters, each of which is freely available to read on this portal:</p>
			<div class="toc-list">
				{thesisChapters.map((chapter) => (
					<a href={`/thesis/${chapter.id}`} class="toc-item">
						<span class="toc-number">{chapter.data.chapterNumber.toString().padStart(2, '0')}</span>
						<div class="toc-info">
							<h3>{chapter.data.title}</h3>
							{chapter.data.description && <p>{chapter.data.description}</p>}
						</div>
						<span class="toc-arrow">→</span>
					</a>
				))}
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- WHO IS THIS BOOK FOR? -->
		<section class="audience-section">
			<h2>Who Is This Book For?</h2>
			<div class="audience-grid">
				<div class="audience-card">
					<div class="audience-icon">📈</div>
					<h3>Economic Historians</h3>
					<p>Rigorous econometric analysis of plantation profitability, labor costs, and the financial architecture of the transatlantic slave trade. Includes original datasets extracted from primary sources at Rigsarkivet.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="audience-card">
					<div class="audience-icon">🌴</div>
					<h3>Caribbean Studies Students</h3>
					<p>A deep dive into the social, cultural, and economic history of St. Thomas, St. John, and St. Croix — from the arrival of the first Danish colonists in 1672 to the 1917 Transfer to the United States.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="audience-card">
					<div class="audience-icon">🇩🇰</div>
					<h3>Danish Heritage Researchers</h3>
					<p>A crucial resource for understanding Denmark's often-overlooked colonial past. Ideal for genealogists, museum professionals, and educators working to integrate colonial history into the Danish national narrative.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="audience-card">
					<div class="audience-icon">📚</div>
					<h3>General Readers</h3>
					<p>Written to be accessible beyond academia. If you are interested in how colonialism shaped the modern world — and how the numbers reveal what the narratives often hide — this book is for you.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- WEBSITE VS BOOK COMPARISON -->
		<section class="comparison-section">
			<h2>Website vs. Book</h2>
			<p class="comparison-intro">The research portal you are browsing is free and open. The book goes further.</p>
			<div class="comparison-table-wrapper">
				<table class="comparison-table">
					<thead>
						<tr>
							<th>Feature</th>
							<th>Website <span class="free-tag">Free</span></th>
							<th>Book <span class="book-tag">Purchase</span></th>
						</tr>
					</thead>
					<tbody>
						<tr><td>Full thesis chapters</td><td class="check">✓</td><td class="check">✓</td></tr>
						<tr><td>Interactive Data Explorer</td><td class="check">✓</td><td class="dash">—</td></tr>
						<tr><td>Memorial Register</td><td class="check">✓</td><td class="dash">—</td></tr>
						<tr><td>Video Lectures</td><td class="check">✓</td><td class="dash">—</td></tr>
						<tr><td>Exclusive Foreword</td><td class="dash">—</td><td class="check">✓</td></tr>
						<tr><td>Extended Analysis & Commentary</td><td class="dash">—</td><td class="check">✓</td></tr>
						<tr><td>High-Resolution Archival Images</td><td class="dash">—</td><td class="check">✓</td></tr>
						<tr><td>Comprehensive Printed Bibliography</td><td class="dash">—</td><td class="check">✓</td></tr>
						<tr><td>Formatted for Academic Citation</td><td class="dash">—</td><td class="check">✓</td></tr>
						<tr><td>Physical Keepsake</td><td class="dash">—</td><td class="check">✓</td></tr>
					</tbody>
				</table>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- FORMATS & EDITIONS -->
		<section class="formats-section">
			<h2>Formats & Editions</h2>
			<p class="formats-intro">Choose the format that suits your reading style.</p>
			<div class="formats-grid">
				<div class="format-card">
					<div class="format-icon">📕</div>
					<h3>Hardcover</h3>
					<p class="format-desc">A premium clothbound edition with gold foil lettering, high-resolution archival images, and a printed bibliography. A keepsake for your shelf.</p>
					<span class="format-price">Price TBA</span>
				</div>
				<div class="format-card">
					<div class="format-icon">📱</div>
					<h3>eBook</h3>
					<p class="format-desc">A digital edition available as PDF and ePub. Fully searchable, with clickable cross-references and hyperlinked bibliography. Read on any device.</p>
					<span class="format-price">Price TBA</span>
				</div>
				<div class="format-card">
					<div class="format-icon">🎧</div>
					<h3>Audiobook</h3>
					<p class="format-desc">A narrated edition bringing the colonial archives to life. Hear the data, the diary entries, and the economic analysis read aloud by the authors themselves.</p>
					<span class="format-price">Price TBA</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- FAQ -->
		<section class="faq-section">
			<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
			<div class="faq-list">
				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>When will the book be published?</summary>
					<div class="faq-answer">
						<p>We are currently finalizing the manuscript following our thesis defense. The expected publication date is early 2027. Sign up for the waitlist above to be notified the moment it becomes available.</p>
					</div>
				</details>
				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>What formats will it be available in?</summary>
					<div class="faq-answer">
						<p>We plan to offer the book in three formats: a premium hardcover edition, a digital eBook (PDF & ePub), and a narrated audiobook read by the authors. See the Formats & Editions section above for details. Pricing will be announced closer to the publication date.</p>
					</div>
				</details>
				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>Can I cite this book in academic work?</summary>
					<div class="faq-answer">
						<p>Yes. The self-published book will include an ISBN and will be formatted for proper academic citation (Chicago, APA, etc.). We will provide a recommended citation format on this page upon publication.</p>
					</div>
				</details>
				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>Will there be a Danish edition?</summary>
					<div class="faq-answer">
						<p>The initial publication will be in English. A Danish-language edition is under consideration depending on demand. If you would like to see a Danish edition, please let us know via the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
					</div>
				</details>
				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>How is the book different from the free online thesis?</summary>
					<div class="faq-answer">
						<p>The book includes an exclusive foreword, extended analysis and commentary not found on the website, high-resolution archival images, and a comprehensive printed bibliography. It is also formatted as a cohesive, citable academic publication rather than a collection of web pages. See the comparison table above for a full breakdown.</p>
					</div>
				</details>
				<details class="faq-item">
					<summary>Where can I buy it?</summary>
					<div class="faq-answer">
						<p>The book will be available for purchase directly through this website and through major online retailers. Distribution details will be announced upon publication.</p>
					</div>
				</details>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ENDORSEMENTS -->
		<section class="endorsements-section">
			<h2>Endorsements</h2>
			<div class="endorsement-grid">
				<blockquote class="endorsement-card">
					<p>"A placeholder for an endorsement from your thesis supervisor or examiner. This section is ready for you to fill in once you receive quotes."</p>
					<cite>— Prof. [Supervisor Name], University of Copenhagen</cite>
				</blockquote>
				<blockquote class="endorsement-card">
					<p>"A second placeholder for an endorsement from a peer reviewer, external examiner, or fellow academic who has read early drafts of the manuscript."</p>
					<cite>— Dr. [Reviewer Name], [Institution]</cite>
				</blockquote>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- PRE-ORDER / WAITLIST SIGNUP -->
		<section class="waitlist-section" id="notify">
			<div class="waitlist-card">
				<div class="waitlist-icon">📖</div>
				<h2>Get Notified on Launch</h2>
				<p>Be the first to know when the book is available for purchase. Enter your email below and we will notify you on publication day.</p>
				<form class="waitlist-form" id="waitlist-form">
					<div class="form-row">
						<input type="email" id="waitlist-email" placeholder="your.email@example.com" required autocomplete="email" />
						<button type="submit" class="btn-submit">Notify Me</button>
					</div>
					<p class="form-note">We respect your privacy. Your email will only be used for book launch notifications.</p>
				</form>
				<div id="waitlist-success" class="waitlist-success hidden">
					<span class="success-icon">✓</span>
					<p>Thank you! You'll be notified when the book launches.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- CONNECT -->
		<section class="connect-section">
			<p>Follow the lead author for updates on the book, the video series, and future research:</p>
			<div class="connect-buttons">
				<a href="https://www.youtube.com/@thewanderingeconomist" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-promo youtube">
					<span class="icon">▶</span> YouTube
				</a>
				<a href="https://www.antonebsen.dk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-promo website">
					<span class="icon">🌐</span> AntonEbsen.dk
				</a>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.page-container {
		max-width: 1100px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
	}

	.back-link {
		display: inline-block; margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
		color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;
		transition: color var(--transition-fast); text-decoration: none;
	}
	.back-link:hover { color: var(--color-accent); }

	.label {
		display: inline-block; font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--color-accent);
		background: rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.1); padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
		border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
	}

	/* =========================================
	   HERO
	   ========================================= */
	.book-hero {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
		gap: var(--space-2xl);
		align-items: center;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
		padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
		border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.2);
	}

	.hero-image {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.cover-img {
		max-height: 500px;
		width: auto;
		border-radius: 4px;
		box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 0 40px rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.1);
		transition: transform 0.4s ease;
	}
	.cover-img:hover {
		transform: scale(1.03) rotate(-1deg);
	}

	.hero-text h1 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 2.8rem;
		color: var(--color-text);
		margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
		line-height: 1.15;
	}

	.hero-subtitle {
		font-size: 1.3rem;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		font-style: italic;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
	}

	.hero-authors {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
	}

	.hero-blurb {
		color: var(--color-text);
		line-height: 1.7;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
	}

	.hero-cta {
		display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.btn-primary {
		display: inline-block; padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;
		background: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-bg);
		border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: bold; transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}
	.btn-primary:hover {
		background: #d6b88a; transform: translateY(-2px);
		box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.3);
	}

	.btn-secondary {
		display: inline-block; padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;
		background: transparent; color: var(--color-text);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 4px;
		text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}
	.btn-secondary:hover {
		border-color: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	/* =========================================
	   KEY FACTS
	   ========================================= */
	.key-facts {
		display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
		gap: var(--space-md); margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
		text-align: center;
	}
	.fact {
		background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: 8px; padding: var(--space-lg);
		display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.3rem;
	}
	.fact-number {
		font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 2.5rem;
		color: var(--color-accent); line-height: 1;
	}
	.fact-label {
		font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}

	/* =========================================
	   BLURB
	   ========================================= */
	.blurb-section {
		margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
		padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
		border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.2);
	}
	.blurb-section h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 2rem;
		color: var(--color-text); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
		text-align: center;
	}
	.blurb-content {
		max-width: 750px; margin: 0 auto;
	}
	.blurb-content p {
		color: var(--color-text); font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	/* =========================================
	   TABLE OF CONTENTS
	   ========================================= */
	.toc-section {
		margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
		padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
		border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.2);
	}
	.toc-section h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 2rem;
		color: var(--color-text); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
		text-align: center;
	}
	.toc-intro {
		text-align: center; color: var(--color-text-muted);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); font-style: italic;
	}
	.toc-list {
		display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem;
	}
	.toc-item {
		display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-md);
		padding: 0.8rem var(--space-md);
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: 6px;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
	}
	.toc-item:hover {
		border-color: rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.4);
		transform: translateX(4px);
	}
	.toc-number {
		font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem;
		color: var(--color-accent); min-width: 40px;
	}
	.toc-info { flex: 1; }
	.toc-info h3 { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-text); margin: 0 0 0.2rem 0; }
	.toc-info p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin: 0; }
	.toc-arrow { color: var(--color-accent); font-size: 1.2rem; transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
	.toc-item:hover .toc-arrow { transform: translateX(4px); }

	/* =========================================
	   ENDORSEMENTS
	   ========================================= */
	.endorsements-section {
		margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
		padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
		border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.2);
	}
	.endorsements-section h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 2rem;
		color: var(--color-text); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
		text-align: center;
	}
	.endorsement-grid {
		display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: var(--space-lg);
	}
	.endorsement-card {
		background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
		border-radius: 8px; padding: var(--space-lg);
		margin: 0;
	}
	.endorsement-card p {
		color: var(--color-text); font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.6; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
	}
	.endorsement-card cite {
		color: var(--color-accent); font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-style: normal;
	}

	/* =========================================
	   FORMATS & EDITIONS
	   ========================================= */
	.formats-section {
		margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
		padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
		border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.2);
	}
	.formats-section h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 2rem;
		color: var(--color-text); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
		text-align: center;
	}
	.formats-intro {
		text-align: center; color: var(--color-text-muted);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); font-style: italic;
	}
	.formats-grid {
		display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: var(--space-lg);
	}
	.format-card {
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: 8px; padding: var(--space-xl);
		text-align: center;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}
	.format-card:hover {
		border-color: rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.4);
		transform: translateY(-5px);
		box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
	}
	.format-icon {
		font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}
	.format-card h3 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.3rem;
		color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}
	.format-desc {
		color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;
		line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}
	.format-price {
		display: inline-block;
		font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 0.85rem;
		text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		background: rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.1);
		padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 20px;
	}

	/* =========================================
	   WAITLIST / PRE-ORDER
	   ========================================= */
	.waitlist-section {
		margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
	}
	.waitlist-card {
		background: rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.05);
		border: 1px solid rgba(196, 167, 125, 0.2);
		border-radius: 12px;
		padding: var(--space-2xl);
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}
	.waitlist-icon {
		font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}
	.waitlist-card h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.8rem;
		color: var(--color-text); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
	}
	.waitlist-card > p {
		color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
		line-height: 1.5;
	}
	.form-row {
		display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto;
	}
	#waitlist-email {
		flex: 1; padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		background: var(--color-bg); color: var(--color-text);
		border-radius: 4px; font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: 1rem;
	}
	#waitlist-email:focus {
